    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KM PROPERTY is delighted to present to the market Apartment 44 Milbank. This bright and spacious two-bedroom top-floor apartment, ideally positioned within a highly regarded and gated development located within minutes of Portmarnock Village. \n\nViewing Video: https://youtu.be/9sO2lRIuc2g\n\nOffering approximately 70 sqm. of well-proportioned accommodation, the apartment provides an excellent balance of comfortable living space. Its top-floor position creates a wonderful sense of privacy, while the generous living accommodation is complemented by a private balcony, providing an ideal space to enjoy a morning coffee, unwind in the evening or simply take in the surroundings. There is a separate kitchen, and the two bedrooms are well appointed and feature large windows and built in wardrobes. The main bedroom has an en-suite and an upgraded bathroom completes the accommodation. \n\nThe Links is a well-established and attractive residential development set behind secure gated entrances, with beautifully maintained communal grounds and mature landscaped areas.\nResidents also benefit from access to a private tennis court, providing a rare recreational amenity within the development. The combination of landscaped communal areas, security and resident facilities creates a pleasant and established setting. \n\nPortmarnock is renowned for its beautiful coastline, with Portmarnock Beach and the expansive Velvet Strand providing an exceptional setting for walks, running, swimming and enjoying the outdoors. The beach and surrounding coastal amenities are within easy reach of the development. There is also a selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday services. For commuters, the proximity of Portmarnock DART Station is a major advantage. The station is within easy walking distance of The Links and provides convenient rail connections towards Dublin City Centre and along the northside DART network.\n\nWith the combination of excellent transport links, proximity to Portmarnock village and easy access to the coast, Apartment 44 offers the opportunity to enjoy a relaxed coastal lifestyle while remaining well connected to Dublin.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.23m (4'0\") x 3.35m (11'0\")\nThe spacious hallway is finished with wooden flooring and has access to a hot press and a large storage press. A pull-down attic ladder provides access to a large, floored space this area offers further storage.\n\nLiving Room - 3.65m (12'0\") x 4.18m (13'9\")\nOffering an ideal space to relax or entertain the living room is flooded with natural light and opens directly onto the private terrace. There is an additional storage press housing an updated gas boiler. The ceiling is finished with ceiling, coving and recessed spotlights. Wooden flooring.\n\n\nKitchen - 2.92m (9'7\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\nThe well-appointed kitchen is fitted with wall and floor units and has plumbing for a dishwasher and washing machine.\n\nBedroom One - 3.04m (10'0\") x 3.89m (12'9\")\nThis large double bedroom has built in wardrobes large window that overlooks the communal grounds and access to an en-suite. The space is finished with wooden flooring.\n\nEn-Suite\nThe ensuite is fitted with WC, wash hand, basin and walk-in shower with tiled surround and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.4m (11'2\") x 3.68m (12'1\")\nThis generous double bedroom also has built in wardrobes that offer plenty of storage, A large window overlooks the communal gardens.\n\nBathroom - 1.85m (6'1\") x 2.12m (6'11\")\nThe upgraded bathroom is fitted with WC, wash hand basin bath with overhead shower with tiled surround and tiled flooring.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
